      "created_at": "2025-10-15T04:02:48.795Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone,<br>\nI have configured Microsoft OAuth 2.0 for my incoming and outgoing mail setup in Frappe. However, incoming emails are received with a delay of about 5–15 minutes. I want them to be received immediately, similar to how mail clients work. How can I fix this delay?</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/rineesha-soxo/{size}/86158_2.png",
      "trust_level": 1,
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
