      "created_at": "2025-10-15T05:27:22.048Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Changing it in frappe framework means you need to send a PR.</p>\n<p>If you have custom app, use <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/framework/user/en/python-api/hooks#scheduler-events\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Hooks</a> and call it more frequently. Note that it will also be called every 10 min by frappe.</p>",
